OL,3,GNEWSAThe church service held on a
OL,4,Afairground ride
OL,5,
OL,6,FHave you ever attended a church service
OL,7,Fon a funfair ride? Or seen a reverend
OL,8,Fgiving a sermon from a Sky Flyer?
OL,10,FOne of the country's oldest fairs
OL,11,Fenjoys this tradition every year in the
OL,12,Fcentre of Oxford.
OL,14,FSt Giles' Fair originated in 1625 and
OL,15,Feach year a special blessing is given
OL,16,Fthe night before it begins.
OL,18,FThe service is held on the ride owned
OL,19,Fby the Noyce family, whose involvement
OL,20,Fin the fair goes back generations.
